WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.020
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.860
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.860 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.740 --> 00:31.290
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.020
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.530 --> 00:58.300
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.300 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.010
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.010 --> 01:08.860
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.860 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.530 --> 01:25.180
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.850 --> 01:43.210
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.509 --> 01:46.810
=Episode 31=

02:10.280 --> 02:11.110
(Where am I?)

02:13.230 --> 02:14.290
(Where is everyone?)

02:36.720 --> 02:38.230
(After coming back from the Time Rift,)

02:39.280 --> 02:40.600
(I haven't rested well.)

03:17.920 --> 03:18.600
Jinzhao.

03:19.480 --> 03:20.440
You finally woke up.

03:21.630 --> 03:22.070
Wait for me.

03:22.070 --> 03:22.880
Stay here.

03:30.000 --> 03:30.480
Jinzhao.

03:31.390 --> 03:34.000
I made noodles with eggs for you.

03:34.230 --> 03:34.950
Have some.

03:42.880 --> 03:45.040
Only when I grow up
can I become stronger

03:45.670 --> 03:47.280
and protect those I want to protect.

03:48.440 --> 03:49.110
Jinzhao.

03:49.670 --> 03:51.510
I want to protect you too.

04:14.600 --> 04:15.310
How is it?

04:20.670 --> 04:21.190
It's alright.

04:23.920 --> 04:25.110
Just alright?

04:29.790 --> 04:30.720
Actually,

04:31.520 --> 04:33.640
you've grasped some essence of noodles

04:39.080 --> 04:39.790
I've decided

04:40.640 --> 04:42.520
to give our noodles a name.

04:45.310 --> 04:46.159
Let's call it

04:46.790 --> 04:48.080
Yue's Egg Noodles.

04:48.400 --> 04:48.920
Sound good?

04:51.600 --> 04:52.430
Jinzhao.

04:53.310 --> 04:53.990
You

04:53.990 --> 04:56.670
are terrible at picking names,

04:57.430 --> 04:59.110
just like the noodles you make.

05:01.400 --> 05:02.960
It's been three years.

05:03.160 --> 05:03.990
In your noodles,

05:03.990 --> 05:06.550
there are always just
two greens and an egg.

05:06.990 --> 05:08.400
What?

05:08.870 --> 05:10.160
Any problem with that?

05:10.160 --> 05:12.550
Yes, I'm telling the absolute truth.

05:12.790 --> 05:14.080
You can't tell the absolute truth.

05:14.080 --> 05:15.480
But only partial truth.

05:15.870 --> 05:17.520
Brother.

05:21.430 --> 05:22.480
Why are you here?

05:23.310 --> 05:23.870
Brother.

05:23.990 --> 05:25.870
Didn't you promise to
make me a grass dragonfly?

05:26.190 --> 05:27.350
When will you do it?

05:28.920 --> 05:29.790
(Why does it feel odd?)

05:30.350 --> 05:32.480
(Feels like I'm living
someone else's life.)

05:33.190 --> 05:34.670
(But Qi feels so familiar.)

05:35.110 --> 05:35.720
Brother?

05:38.520 --> 05:38.790
Come.

05:39.350 --> 05:39.670
Let me.

05:48.080 --> 05:50.550
Why do you always cling to my brother?

05:51.280 --> 05:52.790
Children should have manners.

05:52.790 --> 05:53.640
Call me sister.

05:54.520 --> 05:56.080
No, I already have a sister.

05:56.280 --> 05:57.190
Really?

05:57.190 --> 05:58.720
If you call me sister,

05:58.720 --> 06:00.720
I can make noodles for you.

06:01.720 --> 06:02.480
You are so annoying.

06:11.430 --> 06:13.080
Luohuan, have you finished?

06:13.480 --> 06:13.960
Almost.

06:16.870 --> 06:17.230
Done.

06:20.160 --> 06:22.350
Luohuan, is this a dragonfly?

06:22.480 --> 06:24.430
You used to do it so well.

06:24.430 --> 06:26.280
Why is it so ugly?

06:27.640 --> 06:28.520
That's right.

06:29.160 --> 06:31.160
Your brother has never been good at

06:31.400 --> 06:33.230
drawing or knitting straw.

06:33.480 --> 06:34.280
That's not true.

06:39.920 --> 06:42.600
I mean, I can draw.

06:42.600 --> 06:44.350
But I don't knit so well.

06:44.750 --> 06:46.159
I made one though, didn't I?

06:47.400 --> 06:47.960
You doubt it?

06:48.159 --> 06:49.720
I'll get the ones he made before.

06:56.310 --> 06:57.480
You're good at drawing?

06:58.720 --> 06:59.430
Of course.

07:04.480 --> 07:05.160
Let's go for a walk.

07:05.670 --> 07:05.990
Okay.

07:13.230 --> 07:14.990
Why didn't he wait for me

07:14.990 --> 07:15.990
like he used to?

07:41.400 --> 07:42.080
Everyone says

07:43.670 --> 07:45.550
that Yujie Hub is my home,

07:47.520 --> 07:49.310
but this place seems so strange to me.

07:51.480 --> 07:52.750
I'm only familiar with you,

07:54.520 --> 07:55.159
Shifang,

07:56.550 --> 07:57.190
Xian Qing,

07:58.280 --> 08:00.870
Zhaoyan, and Ming Xiu.

08:10.430 --> 08:11.230
Me too.

08:12.960 --> 08:13.990
I don't know why.

08:14.480 --> 08:16.040
After returning from Guixu,

08:17.110 --> 08:20.120
I have a new understanding

08:20.240 --> 08:21.590
regarding myself being a weapon.

08:22.120 --> 08:22.790
Everyone

08:22.790 --> 08:24.710
has things beyond their control.

08:25.920 --> 08:27.670
I'm not the only one suffering.

08:29.040 --> 08:30.310
If Zhu Yu loses control,

08:30.670 --> 08:32.429
the entire realm will be
plunged into misery.

08:34.190 --> 08:35.400
I think I'm doing the right thing

08:36.400 --> 08:37.830
by stopping her.

09:18.710 --> 09:19.160
Sit.

09:28.790 --> 09:29.830
Let's clear things up first.

09:31.240 --> 09:31.710
Firstly,

09:32.430 --> 09:33.670
in the past three years,

09:34.310 --> 09:35.950
Hengdao Sect is an enemy to me.

09:37.040 --> 09:38.190
If you want me to do something,

09:38.920 --> 09:40.280
please clarify it first.

09:41.280 --> 09:42.160
If I agree,

09:42.920 --> 09:43.950
I can do it for you.

09:58.790 --> 10:00.040
I know

10:00.640 --> 10:02.520
you have deep connections
with the Zhengwu Alliance.

10:03.400 --> 10:05.950
I want you to represent the Hengdao Sect

10:06.470 --> 10:09.670
and propose a collaboration
with Zuo Guanren.

10:10.240 --> 10:11.710
Together we fight against Zhu Yu.

10:14.640 --> 10:15.710
Zhu Yu is in the sky.

10:16.470 --> 10:17.640
What can Zuo Guanren do?

10:21.310 --> 10:22.760
I have already given her

10:23.830 --> 10:25.880
the fake Rehai key ring.

10:26.310 --> 10:28.670
Zhu Yu has long coveted
the power of Rehai.

10:29.000 --> 10:31.520
She will surely bring
the Yu Clan to the earth.

10:32.000 --> 10:34.160
By then, Zhengwu Alliance
will restrain the Yu Clan,

10:34.240 --> 10:36.520
while we unbind Mist Soul and Zhu Yu.

10:36.790 --> 10:38.120
Will Zhu Yu buy it?

10:40.550 --> 10:42.710
She does not know the key ring is fake.

10:42.950 --> 10:44.920
When she tries to open Rehai,

10:45.120 --> 10:46.760
as long as Luo Zhaoyan can secretly

10:47.400 --> 10:48.710
use the real key ring

10:48.790 --> 10:49.880
to help her,

10:50.830 --> 10:54.240
she will absorb the power of Rehai

10:55.240 --> 10:56.950
and provoke the Mist Soul

10:57.670 --> 10:59.590
to initiate the spell for unbinding.

11:01.520 --> 11:03.120
After Zhu Yu loses
the power of Mist Soul,

11:03.710 --> 11:04.920
her transformation will continue

11:04.920 --> 11:05.830
and put her in agony.

11:06.640 --> 11:08.360
She will return to the Mist Soul

11:09.040 --> 11:10.310
to suppress her transformation.

11:11.280 --> 11:12.710
That's when she's at her weakest,

11:13.830 --> 11:15.790
and the best time to kill her.

11:17.360 --> 11:18.240
At that time,

11:18.830 --> 11:21.550
we will bombard her in Yujie Hub

11:22.760 --> 11:23.920
to try to injure her

11:24.400 --> 11:25.790
and buy you time.

11:29.550 --> 11:31.240
I mean no disrespect.

11:32.590 --> 11:34.190
But your attacks

11:35.120 --> 11:36.640
couldn't leave a scratch on her.

11:37.190 --> 11:37.950
Not necessarily.

11:39.240 --> 11:41.520
If we hit the weakest spot on her scale,

11:42.470 --> 11:43.760
there would be a miracle.

11:49.670 --> 11:51.280
You've planned everything.

11:52.360 --> 11:53.760
If I can't persuade
the Zhengwu Alliance,

11:54.550 --> 11:55.550
none of it could happen.

11:58.670 --> 12:00.710
There have been
occurrences of petrification

12:01.120 --> 12:02.880
all over the land.

12:03.830 --> 12:06.000
According to Zhu Yu's route,

12:06.400 --> 12:07.160
I'll say

12:08.000 --> 12:10.670
that her next destination is Jing'an.

12:15.550 --> 12:16.400
Why didn't you say so?

12:22.640 --> 12:23.310
I understand now.

12:24.790 --> 12:25.830
You're only saying it now

12:26.520 --> 12:28.950
because you want the Zhengwu Alliance
to get a taste of Zhu Yu's power

12:29.590 --> 12:30.950
and force them to cooperate with you.

12:32.310 --> 12:33.640
Is it not possible to tell the people

12:33.880 --> 12:35.310
to leave the city and seek refuge?

12:36.070 --> 12:37.120
Will it cost you your lives?

12:53.470 --> 12:54.280
How strange.

12:55.670 --> 12:57.520
I always feel that

12:59.000 --> 13:00.790
we should be close to him.

13:02.310 --> 13:03.120
Is it an illusion?

13:11.070 --> 13:11.920
It must be.

13:13.520 --> 13:13.920
Qi.

13:15.120 --> 13:15.470
Qi?

13:17.360 --> 13:19.000
Jinzhao, what is it?

13:19.120 --> 13:20.430
We are setting off for Jing'an.

13:20.760 --> 13:21.520
I'll explain it later.

13:22.070 --> 13:23.120
Hurry and call the others.

13:23.400 --> 13:23.710
Quick.

13:32.190 --> 13:33.190
For the Hengdao Sect,

13:33.430 --> 13:34.790
life is something that can be measured.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.280
The lives of millions of people

13:37.710 --> 13:39.240
are insignificant compared
to the lives of all

13:39.310 --> 13:40.070
in the Six Realms.

13:41.000 --> 13:42.040
Let alone it's just

13:42.040 --> 13:43.470
the lives of the civilians
in Jing'an City.

13:44.670 --> 13:46.360
They watch the world from above.

13:47.240 --> 13:48.430
They must feel like god.

13:50.070 --> 13:52.880
They don't take people seriously at all.

13:53.920 --> 13:54.880
Not just the Hengdao Sect,

13:55.830 --> 13:58.040
nor does Zhu Yu.

13:59.920 --> 14:00.430
Exactly.

14:03.160 --> 14:04.670
No one should be given up.

14:05.240 --> 14:06.640
Every life deserves respect.

14:08.070 --> 14:08.670
Qi is right.

14:09.310 --> 14:11.590
Even the smallest life is unique,

14:12.240 --> 14:13.190
and has the right to live.

14:15.470 --> 14:16.590
Once we arrive in Jing'an,

14:16.790 --> 14:18.880
we must ask the Zhengwu Alliance
to convince the residents

14:19.070 --> 14:20.310
to flee as far away as possible.

14:22.070 --> 14:22.590
Miss Ming,

14:23.760 --> 14:25.520
why don't you and Qi

14:26.000 --> 14:27.470
go see how far Jing'an is from here?

14:42.710 --> 14:44.190
You deliberately sent them away.

14:44.590 --> 14:46.190
Is there something you
want to discuss with me?

14:47.520 --> 14:48.470
I suspect that Ying Xuwei

14:48.670 --> 14:50.280
kept the method to undo the bindings

14:50.400 --> 14:51.760
from me.

14:53.120 --> 14:53.640
Why would he?

14:55.040 --> 14:56.470
They say opening Rehai

14:56.590 --> 14:57.880
would free the Mist Soul.

14:58.280 --> 14:59.190
But on that day,

15:00.280 --> 15:03.040
Zhu Yu will lead
the Yu clan to the earth,

15:03.670 --> 15:05.120
far away from the Mist Soul.

15:05.950 --> 15:07.640
How can we be sure
the Mist Soul will be freed

15:08.120 --> 15:09.920
just by absorbing the power of Rehai?

15:13.590 --> 15:14.790
Perhaps he kept it from you

15:15.830 --> 15:17.400
because he thought
you couldn't accept it.

15:18.040 --> 15:19.120
So he avoided talking about it.

15:22.640 --> 15:24.590
There's only one thing I can't accept.

15:25.360 --> 15:26.590
That is to harm those I care about.

15:28.950 --> 15:30.280
Look, the dark clouds over there.

15:36.400 --> 15:37.160
It's Zhu Yu.

15:41.760 --> 15:42.800
There's no time.

15:43.120 --> 15:43.950
We must hurry down.

16:14.310 --> 16:14.790
Slow down.

16:16.000 --> 16:16.640
Are you okay?

16:17.240 --> 16:17.710
Over here.

16:23.190 --> 16:23.710
Miss Ming.

16:27.470 --> 16:27.950
What's wrong?

16:28.430 --> 16:29.070
His leg.

16:29.470 --> 16:29.950
Let me do it.

16:31.920 --> 16:32.430
It's fine.

16:34.880 --> 16:35.670
It'll be over soon.

17:11.920 --> 17:12.190
Come.

17:12.319 --> 17:12.560
here.

17:13.079 --> 17:13.470
Here.

17:13.750 --> 17:14.400
Have some water.

17:19.800 --> 17:20.319
Thank you.

17:25.190 --> 17:26.400
You haven't rested for a long time.

17:26.950 --> 17:27.599
Go rest.

17:28.840 --> 17:29.510
I'm fine.

17:31.990 --> 17:33.990
Yue and Miss Yue are having it harder

17:34.360 --> 17:35.800
in the Jing'an City.

17:55.030 --> 17:56.920
Jinzhao, I can absorb the Qiyuan Orb.

17:57.640 --> 17:58.360
I want to save them.

18:01.160 --> 18:01.670
I'll help you.

18:03.030 --> 18:03.510
Together.

18:16.620 --> 18:20.350
♪I've never dreamed of the world♪

18:20.590 --> 18:23.430
♪The young man growing up carefree♪

18:23.430 --> 18:26.150
♪Toasts to the sun and moon♪

18:26.150 --> 18:28.540
♪He knows nothing about grief♪

18:28.810 --> 18:31.440
♪Shatter the moonlight with sword♪

18:31.440 --> 18:34.650
♪Drowned in wine, getting wasted♪

18:34.650 --> 18:38.630
♪The world is everchanging♪

18:39.340 --> 18:42.830
♪To guard the light in this world♪

18:42.830 --> 18:45.410
♪You're the light in my world♪

18:45.410 --> 18:47.880
♪My yearning becomes real♪

18:47.880 --> 18:50.160
♪The vicissitudes of life♪

18:50.160 --> 18:53.360
♪The world is in turbulence. So what♪

18:53.360 --> 18:59.280
♪You're fighting the world alongside me♪

19:00.460 --> 19:03.870
♪Write a legend with my sword♪

19:03.870 --> 19:06.820
♪You and me, side by side♪

19:06.820 --> 19:10.510
♪Fearless of love and hatred♪

19:10.980 --> 19:14.760
♪The destined path
is full of turbulence♪

19:14.760 --> 19:17.420
♪Yet it bothers me not♪

19:17.420 --> 19:22.160
♪I wander around, creating legends♪

19:25.320 --> 19:25.920
Your medicine.

19:58.470 --> 20:00.230
Did Jinzhao and Yue succeed?

20:02.430 --> 20:04.190
Let's take the people back to Jing'an

20:04.920 --> 20:06.990
and then meet Mr. Yue and Miss Yue.

20:28.120 --> 20:28.430
Qi.

20:28.710 --> 20:30.600
Yue, are you okay?

20:33.950 --> 20:34.560
Jinzhao.

20:35.160 --> 20:36.710
I'll stay here.

20:37.360 --> 20:38.670
You guys go to the Zhengwu Alliance.

20:42.400 --> 20:42.710
Okay.

20:45.230 --> 20:45.750
Miss Yue.

20:46.710 --> 20:47.700
Let's go together.

20:52.460 --> 20:54.950
(Zhengwu Alliance)

21:01.400 --> 21:01.800
Leader.

21:02.360 --> 21:02.990
What is it?

21:03.470 --> 21:05.160
Quite a few members in the alliance

21:05.360 --> 21:06.560
also wear Qiyuan Orbs.

21:21.190 --> 21:21.640
Lingyun.

21:25.840 --> 21:26.270
Leader.

21:26.360 --> 21:27.570
- In the alliance...
- Mr. Zuo.

21:28.560 --> 21:29.080
Mr. Zuo.

21:31.750 --> 21:32.400
Mr. Yue.

21:33.030 --> 21:34.640
Jing'an City has suffered
a great calamity.

21:35.600 --> 21:37.190
I must deal with it first.

21:38.430 --> 21:39.880
You can do as you wish.

21:40.320 --> 21:40.600
Come.

21:44.270 --> 21:45.160
To the Jiqiao Hall.

21:46.160 --> 21:46.600
Okay.

21:50.360 --> 21:53.080
Why are there victims of
the Qiyuan Orbs in the alliance?

21:53.640 --> 21:54.360
Find it out.

21:54.600 --> 21:55.030
Yes.

21:58.750 --> 21:59.990
In more than two hundred years,

22:00.320 --> 22:02.230
Rehai, which should've moved
in a defined trajectory,

22:02.880 --> 22:04.160
was bound to my family by Maiming.

22:04.990 --> 22:06.670
Now, the Bloodbinding has been lifted.

22:07.030 --> 22:08.750
Naturally, it returns to its course.

22:13.950 --> 22:15.080
This is a map of the Luo family.

22:15.080 --> 22:15.600
Look.

22:19.920 --> 22:22.670
If we connect these places.

22:24.430 --> 22:25.880
The moving trajectory of Rehai.

22:28.030 --> 22:29.320
Rehai is the force of life.

22:30.080 --> 22:31.230
Wherever it's been,

22:31.270 --> 22:32.030
there'll form an oasis

22:32.270 --> 22:33.360
over a long period.

22:34.510 --> 22:36.400
Even today, in places
like Zangfeng Plains,

22:36.640 --> 22:38.510
one can still see traces
of its former lushness.

22:40.600 --> 22:41.710
The Yu Clan lived underwater.

22:42.510 --> 22:44.160
They are not suited
to act in arid places.

22:44.710 --> 22:45.800
Zhu Yu certainly won't

22:45.800 --> 22:47.320
absorb Rehai in the desert.

22:48.600 --> 22:49.360
A few days ago,

22:49.600 --> 22:51.440
Rehai began to move
from my family's domain.

22:52.160 --> 22:54.600
A few days ago,
Zhu Yu obtained the key ring.

22:55.030 --> 22:55.320
Then...

23:00.800 --> 23:03.360
If Zhu Yu is to absorb
the power of Rehai,

23:04.030 --> 23:05.470
the next suitable location would be

23:05.880 --> 23:06.560
the Zangfeng Plains.

23:09.030 --> 23:09.710
The premise is

23:10.710 --> 23:12.640
they already know
the trajectory of Rehai.

23:15.510 --> 23:17.230
Perhaps Maiming has
already informed Zhu Yu.

23:18.510 --> 23:20.320
When Maiming lifted
the Bloodbinding of Rehai,

23:20.640 --> 23:22.320
both Leader Ge and
Shuo Xuan were present.

23:22.880 --> 23:24.120
So they've been in touch for a while.

23:25.080 --> 23:26.120
And Ying Xuwei not only knows

23:26.120 --> 23:27.750
I have the real key ring,

23:28.120 --> 23:29.560
he's also prepared
a fake one in advance.

23:30.990 --> 23:31.880
Could the Hengdao Sect

23:31.880 --> 23:33.160
have already joined hands with Maiming

23:33.320 --> 23:34.230
to scheme against Zhu Yu.

23:37.920 --> 23:38.510
Exactly.

23:39.640 --> 23:40.560
If that's the case,

23:41.080 --> 23:42.640
a lot of things can be explained.

23:43.560 --> 23:45.670
They handed the fake key ring to Zhu Yu

23:46.880 --> 23:48.670
to get her and the Yu clan
down to the earth.

23:50.030 --> 23:52.560
Then the Zhengwu Alliance
would stall the Yu Clan

23:53.120 --> 23:54.560
while unbinding the Mist Soul

23:55.080 --> 23:56.190
to weaken Zhu Yu.

23:56.990 --> 23:58.600
After that, the Hengdao Sect

23:58.840 --> 24:00.750
would confront the remaining Yu Clan.

24:02.080 --> 24:03.470
Jinzhao or Yue

24:03.920 --> 24:04.990
would deliver the final blow.

24:08.190 --> 24:09.920
Now the biggest issue is

24:10.560 --> 24:11.950
how to deliver the unbinding

24:12.230 --> 24:13.710
to the Mist Soul inside Kun.

24:15.920 --> 24:17.030
Jinzhao and I

24:17.360 --> 24:18.600
have already discussed this matter.

24:19.470 --> 24:20.510
The Hengdao Sect

24:20.510 --> 24:22.510
may achieve their goal
through our sacrifice.

24:23.400 --> 24:23.920
So, Zhaoyan,

24:24.710 --> 24:25.320
be careful,

24:25.880 --> 24:26.640
no matter what.

24:26.880 --> 24:27.190
Okay.

25:10.640 --> 25:11.840
Because of Zhu Yu,

25:12.560 --> 25:13.800
Jing'an became like this.

25:22.160 --> 25:23.160
Wake up.

25:32.430 --> 25:32.990
Dear.

25:35.190 --> 25:35.920
Father.

25:37.510 --> 25:38.030
Father.

25:40.710 --> 25:41.190
Father.

25:46.710 --> 25:48.160
Wake up, dear.

25:52.880 --> 25:53.640
Mrs. Ji.

25:54.670 --> 25:55.470
Mr. Ji.

26:01.800 --> 26:02.230
Mrs. Ji.

26:03.920 --> 26:04.950
Miss.

26:08.920 --> 26:09.920
I never thought

26:11.750 --> 26:13.470
that the last words I said to him

26:14.360 --> 26:15.640
was scolding him

26:17.430 --> 26:19.710
for buying such expensive
things for the child.

26:27.080 --> 26:28.400
Calm down, Mrs.

26:29.400 --> 26:31.270
Your child is very unstable now.

26:39.710 --> 26:41.160
They are all such good people.

26:42.640 --> 26:43.640
It's all my fault.

26:44.430 --> 26:45.750
If I had come earlier,

26:46.120 --> 26:47.320
Mr. Ji wouldn't...

26:47.320 --> 26:48.160
This is not your fault.

26:50.030 --> 26:50.510
Moreover,

26:52.190 --> 26:53.190
you've already done your best.

26:55.880 --> 26:56.360
Mrs. Ji.

26:57.360 --> 26:58.190
Are you better now?

27:01.430 --> 27:02.400
Thank you.

27:04.160 --> 27:05.160
If it weren't for you,

27:06.320 --> 27:07.560
I fear this child...

27:07.840 --> 27:09.270
Don't say that, Mrs. Ji.

27:09.920 --> 27:11.670
The child will grow up safe and sound

27:11.880 --> 27:12.840
and live a long life.

27:16.030 --> 27:16.640
Mrs. Ji.

27:16.880 --> 27:18.120
Why don't you come with us?

27:18.510 --> 27:19.560
We will take care of you.

27:24.030 --> 27:25.600
We must keep the family business going.

27:27.560 --> 27:29.470
Even if God does not want us to live,

27:31.670 --> 27:35.510
we will fight to survive no matter what

27:37.920 --> 27:39.400
and carry on

27:40.750 --> 27:41.990
his father's legacy.

27:57.710 --> 28:00.230
Zhu Yu, do you see?

28:00.800 --> 28:03.030
You see them as insignificant,

28:04.360 --> 28:07.470
but even when their homes are destroyed
and loved ones gone,

28:08.120 --> 28:09.840
they still strive to live.

28:28.750 --> 28:30.190
Grandpa.

28:31.670 --> 28:32.560
Ming Xiu.

28:34.030 --> 28:35.320
She is so sad.

28:37.840 --> 28:38.560
After crying,

28:39.080 --> 28:40.470
one can have the strength to carry on.

28:41.400 --> 28:43.750
Ming Xiu, let's help them.

28:45.710 --> 28:47.030
So many are suffering.

28:48.880 --> 28:49.800
How do we help them all?

28:50.470 --> 28:52.270
Grandpa.

28:54.080 --> 28:56.800
Some mountains are hard to climb

28:58.190 --> 28:59.670
because the person you value

28:59.670 --> 29:00.600
is your mountain.

29:02.190 --> 29:03.190
But for that person,

29:04.670 --> 29:06.230
even if we get injured all over,

29:07.710 --> 29:08.560
we must

29:09.160 --> 29:10.190
climb over that mountain.

29:14.470 --> 29:15.230
Ming Xiu.

29:16.080 --> 29:16.750
I understand.

29:23.270 --> 29:24.600
Let's return to the Zhengwu Alliance.

29:25.230 --> 29:26.560
I have many things to do.

29:28.840 --> 29:29.270
Okay.

29:39.990 --> 29:41.600
The Cold Marrow Garrison
once prophesied,

29:42.320 --> 29:43.470
among the six of you,

29:43.950 --> 29:46.030
two will soon pass away.

29:48.510 --> 29:48.950
Remember.

29:50.470 --> 29:51.640
In the near future,

29:52.880 --> 29:53.670
your life

29:54.670 --> 29:55.750
will come to an end.

29:59.880 --> 30:01.230
Without me around,

30:03.160 --> 30:04.400
will Qi be okay?

30:19.510 --> 30:20.400
I never imagined

30:21.320 --> 30:22.640
the people of Jing'an City

30:23.470 --> 30:25.160
would suffer such heavy casualties.

30:26.430 --> 30:27.950
Such a massive beast.

30:28.670 --> 30:29.880
In her eyes,

30:30.710 --> 30:31.880
those who lost their lives

30:33.030 --> 30:34.710
must be no different from ants.

30:35.600 --> 30:36.030
Leader.

30:36.640 --> 30:37.640
No matter what she is

30:37.950 --> 30:38.950
or how she sees us,

30:39.600 --> 30:40.750
she has harmed my kin,

30:42.400 --> 30:43.950
and we cannot just sit by
and await death.

30:48.270 --> 30:48.710
Shifang.

30:49.950 --> 30:51.430
According to what you just said,

30:52.030 --> 30:54.030
the Hengdao Sect manipulates Qiyuan Sect

30:54.840 --> 30:56.230
in order to restrain Kun.

30:59.880 --> 31:02.470
Regardless of whether
the Hengdao Sect is evil,

31:03.320 --> 31:04.470
they hardly stand a chance

31:05.120 --> 31:07.190
against Kun.

31:08.030 --> 31:08.510
Leader.

31:14.920 --> 31:15.360
Leader.

31:16.430 --> 31:17.080
Chen Qianjun.

31:18.190 --> 31:19.510
Members of the alliance said

31:20.120 --> 31:21.800
it was you who spread the Qiyuan Orbs.

31:23.800 --> 31:24.230
Yes.

31:26.360 --> 31:28.190
Why did you harm your own brothers?

31:29.230 --> 31:30.920
Are you from the Qiyuan Sect too?

31:31.270 --> 31:31.990
I am not.

31:34.080 --> 31:34.750
Earlier,

31:36.750 --> 31:37.400
Xu and I

31:38.080 --> 31:39.710
lost in a contest to
Yue Jinzhao and Ju Shifang.

31:39.990 --> 31:40.940
I couldn't accept it

31:41.190 --> 31:42.320
and wanted to regain face.

31:43.670 --> 31:45.120
Later, when attacking Langyin Pavilion,

31:45.670 --> 31:46.800
I took some orbs.

31:47.400 --> 31:48.230
When wearing the orb,

31:48.920 --> 31:50.750
I felt that my training
progressed faster.

31:51.640 --> 31:52.160
So,

31:53.750 --> 31:55.190
I shared the orbs with the brothers.

31:55.430 --> 31:55.950
You fool!

32:04.750 --> 32:05.230
Jinzhao.

32:06.120 --> 32:06.950
You're waiting for us?

32:08.360 --> 32:09.840
I thought you should be back soon.

32:12.600 --> 32:13.320
I'll head back first.

32:21.320 --> 32:21.950
What's wrong, Qi?

32:22.990 --> 32:23.640
Jinzhao.

32:24.670 --> 32:25.880
Mr. Ji died.

32:31.510 --> 32:33.030
The common folk are innocent.

32:34.080 --> 32:35.920
We must do something.

32:40.990 --> 32:41.430
Definitely.

32:50.320 --> 32:51.560
When we attacked Qiyuan Sect,

32:52.190 --> 32:53.990
I only then realized that it was bad.

32:54.470 --> 32:55.360
I wanted to take it off,

32:56.080 --> 32:57.360
but it had grown into the flesh.

32:58.400 --> 32:59.510
I have also asked doctors.

33:00.270 --> 33:01.080
But the doctors all say

33:01.400 --> 33:02.600
that it's now connected to the heart

33:03.120 --> 33:03.920
and can't be removed.

33:09.160 --> 33:10.030
Did you two

33:10.920 --> 33:12.360
also wear the Qiyuan Orbs?

33:14.320 --> 33:15.710
Fools.

33:17.080 --> 33:17.880
Fine.

33:18.710 --> 33:19.560
Fine.

33:20.120 --> 33:20.640
Leader.

33:21.360 --> 33:22.750
Just now, they were not in Jing'an

33:22.920 --> 33:23.840
and avoided this calamity.

33:24.640 --> 33:25.360
Besides them,

33:25.640 --> 33:27.030
some people wearing the orbs

33:27.030 --> 33:28.160
are out on missions.

33:29.360 --> 33:30.710
Chen Qianjun is guilty.

33:31.120 --> 33:31.840
But first,

33:31.840 --> 33:33.840
we must find a way to
remove the orbs and save them.

33:35.430 --> 33:36.320
Let me try.

33:41.470 --> 33:42.190
Miss Yue.

33:42.990 --> 33:43.360
Leader.

33:44.230 --> 33:45.670
When attacking
Qiyuan Sect's headquarters,

33:45.920 --> 33:47.800
Yue had also saved their disciples.

33:48.190 --> 33:49.470
Just now, she saved many.

33:49.710 --> 33:50.800
Let her have a try.

34:37.469 --> 34:37.989
Miss Yue.

34:39.550 --> 34:42.110
If the orb has been fused
with the body for a long time,

34:42.510 --> 34:44.920
forcibly removing it will
only cost one's life.

34:53.920 --> 34:54.630
Regardless,

34:55.320 --> 34:56.760
thank you for saving my two brothers

34:58.320 --> 34:59.400
and lessening my sins.

35:00.720 --> 35:02.030
Sorry for my offense earlier.

35:02.240 --> 35:03.030
I apologize.

35:03.800 --> 35:04.630
It's alright.

35:07.720 --> 35:08.280
Mr. Zuo.

35:09.760 --> 35:11.720
I represent the Hengdao Sect
to negotiate with you,

35:12.320 --> 35:14.030
hoping to join forces against Zhu Yu.

35:16.630 --> 35:18.030
You represent the Hengdao Sect?

35:18.800 --> 35:20.030
What is your relationship with them?

35:23.590 --> 35:24.280
I am

35:26.430 --> 35:27.880
one of the leaders of the Hengdao Sect.

35:52.070 --> 35:53.470
♪Stars twinkle♪

35:53.470 --> 35:55.470
♪Falling on the lake's surface♪

35:56.260 --> 35:57.470
♪The bright moon gleams♪

35:57.470 --> 35:59.470
♪Illuminating your tender eyes♪

36:00.170 --> 36:02.380
♪Hearing the soft heartbeat by my side♪

36:02.380 --> 36:06.480
♪I make a wish deep within♪

36:08.470 --> 36:09.720
♪Flowers sway gently♪

36:09.720 --> 36:11.810
♪Our eyes are full of affection♪

36:11.810 --> 36:13.730
♪In a low murmur♪

36:13.730 --> 36:15.730
♪We express
our entwined hearts' desires♪

36:15.730 --> 36:19.160
♪Joyfully going
through the endless years♪

36:19.160 --> 36:21.430
♪A breeze stirs the heartstrings♪

36:21.430 --> 36:23.920
♪Red thread twines around fingers♪

36:23.920 --> 36:25.780
♪We've witnessed blossoms
and braved through snow storms♪

36:25.780 --> 36:27.780
♪And braved through snow storms♪

36:27.780 --> 36:31.800
♪Each moment is hard to forget♪

36:31.800 --> 36:34.480
♪The joys, the innocence,
the fearlessness♪

36:34.480 --> 36:36.950
♪And our very images♪

36:36.950 --> 36:38.950
♪All carefully cherished♪

36:38.950 --> 36:42.040
♪I wish to stand side by side with you♪

36:42.040 --> 36:44.370
♪To watch the sun rise and fall♪

36:44.370 --> 36:46.070
♪And the seasons change♪

36:46.070 --> 36:48.880
♪When the wind kisses us softly♪

36:48.880 --> 36:50.880
♪We snuggle and cuddle♪

36:51.210 --> 36:55.220
♪And you embrace me in your dream♪

36:55.220 --> 36:58.260
♪I wish to hold your hand♪

36:58.260 --> 37:00.920
♪Inviting a spring breeze to become♪

37:00.920 --> 37:02.200
♪An eternal pledge♪

37:02.200 --> 37:05.360
♪I wish the wind could hear♪

37:05.360 --> 37:08.280
♪Our loyalty and love for each other♪

37:08.280 --> 37:10.040
♪It's my wish♪

37:10.040 --> 37:13.040
♪And my sole wish for this life♪

